# E-Commerce Customer Analysis

## Project Overview
An e-commerce data analysis project focused on sales performance, customer behavior, product demand, and revenue trends.

## Tools Used
- Power BI
- Python
- Pandas
- SQL
- Excel

## Power BI Dashboard
The dashboard includes:
- Completed and cancelled orders
- Total revenue and average rating
- Revenue by city
- Monthly revenue trends
- Revenue by product category
- Top-selling products

## Project Objectives
- Analyze sales and order performance.
- Compare revenue across cities and product categories.
- Identify popular products.
- Explore customer ratings and purchasing patterns.

## Files
- `Ecommerce_Sales_Dashboard.pbix` — Power BI report
- `ecommerce_dashboard.png` — Dashboard screenshot

## Outcome
An interactive Power BI dashboard that presents e-commerce sales metrics and helps identify business trends.
